#: stefan_stove/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "STOVE"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A burly chef stands in your kitchen, looking at you expectantly as he stirs a sauce pot. Despite his intimidating stature, there's warmth in the depths of his dark eyes."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You must be my new sous chef."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'm Stefan."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/31
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Are you ready for prep?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Prep?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not here to cook."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan regards you in silence for a few long moments."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "THEN WHY ARE YOU HERE?!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-0/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "An adorable chicken-shaped timer slides into the conversation, settling on Stefan's shoulder."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-0/41
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Ba-gawk."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-0/49
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You're right, Mr. Cluckles. I could stand to be nicer."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-0/71
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He takes a deep breath, steadying himself, then points dramatically at you."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-0/79
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You! What are you doing in my kitchen?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-0/87/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ummm... this is my kitchen."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-0/87/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, chef!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-0/87/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you a stove or an oven?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-0/87/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "This is MY kitchen."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-0/87/c-2/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You must have me confused for someone who thinks this kind of thing is funny."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-2/3
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'm BUSY!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-2/14
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I've got a whole lot of folks to feed and unless you are here to help, I need you to step out of th..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-2/22
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Wait...."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-2/30
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Do you smell that?!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-2/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-2/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just your bad attitude."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-2/c-5/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Yet you possess a nose, do you not?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-2/c-5/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I make do with my hood."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Oh, how dare you!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-3/3
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Ba-GAWWWK! Ba-GAWWWK!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-3/11
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Yes, yes, yes, yes. I'm preheated. I know."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-3/22
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Thank you Mr. Cluckles. Always keeping me on track."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-3/33
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Unlike SOME humans who come in MY kitchen just to distract me!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-3/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aww, it's a little chicken timer!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-3/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's my kitchen, dude. End of story."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-3/c-7/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "That little chicken timer offers more help than you can imagine."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-3/c-7/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "He understands the type of establishment I'm trying to run around here!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-3/c-8/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You know, I miss when humans understood the value of the boiling pot of water."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-3/c-8/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "When they would let a sauce properly reduce over time. The aroma of spices filled the air."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-3/c-8/23
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "And everything was home-made."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-3/c-8/31
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "And now all people do is use Food Fetch!!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-3/c-8/39
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "THEY ARE MISSING THE ENTIRE POINT OF IT ALL!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-4/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you even talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-4/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...are you okay?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-4/c-9/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Food. Glorious food!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-4/c-9/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Much more important than whatever little quest you happen to be on right now."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-4/c-10/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Only a human who doesn't understand cooking would ask me that."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-4/c-10/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "COOKING IS LIFE! It is not just food, it is your SOUL!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-4/c-10/26
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Maybe one day, you will understand that."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-4/c-10/34
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Until then, I'm wasting heat standing around here talking to you."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-5/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Anyone ever tell you how rude you are?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-5/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll let you cook."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-5/c-11/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Of course they do."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-5/c-11/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "And they didn't know a crepe from a grape. So I couldn't give a damn about what they say."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-5/c-11/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then I'll leave."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-5/c-11/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait... I know a crepe from a drape? Does that count?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Go on. Shoo."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Okay Mr. Cluckles. All prep should be done in seven and a half minutes."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-6/19
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Start the timer."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-6/27
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Bu bu bu... Ba-Gawk!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_intro/0/g-6/35
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "And... Go!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/4
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "AH! It's you again! Someone must like the heat of the kitchen!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe I like how hot you are!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You haven't calmed down yet?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Oh, I see how it is..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "YOU HAVE NO RESPECT FOR HOW MUCH ATTENTION COOKING TAKES!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "There are plenty of others in this kitchen you can 'date' who AREN'T ME!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Ba ba. Bu ba ba BAGAW."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Yeah, you're right, you're right. You always right!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/g-0/46
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'll calm down."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/g-0/54
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'm blind baking a pie crust, okay? I need to FOCUS!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/g-0/62
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Chat with some of the others and maybe... MAYBE... I'll have time for you."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/g-0/70
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "BAGAWWWWWW! BAGAWWWWW!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/g-0/78
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Ah, yes! It's ready!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_mingle/0/g-0/89
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Go on, boil off! I've got a custard to whip up."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/18
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "FREDDY!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/29
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Stefan! Buddy!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/40
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Hey, don't buddy me. What is it that we talked about last week?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/48
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/56
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Ah, I can't remember."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/64
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "A smart fridge, but yet, you can't remember one simple thing."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/72
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Tell me... why did you order a Slot Pocket from me?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/80
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Oh, because they heat better in the oven!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/88
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "THOSE ARE FOODS FOR LUKE! NOT ME!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/105/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's the big deal?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/106/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Freddy, you don't have to take this."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "What- what- what- What's the big deal?! WHAT'S THE BIG DEAL?!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "I'm glad someone has my back."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/c-1/15/b/1
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Even if you didn't before..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "SEE, THIS IS WHY I..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Bu bu bu... BaGaw."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Okay. Okay. Okay. Cool-down, Stefan. They don't know any better."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-0/30
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I need both of you to listen very... very closely."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-0/38
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I can heat a Slot Pocket to perfection."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-0/46
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "But, I was not given both convection and conduction for it to be wasted on a frozen pastry filled with subpar meat products."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-0/54
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "If you want something like that done, you can talk to Luke."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-0/65
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Not me."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-0/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Both convection and conduction? That's fancy."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-0/74/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Leave you to your fancy foods. Got it."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "So you do know a thing or two... interesting."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "See? Now was that so hard to understand?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "I won't ask you to do that again."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "...but did you do it this time?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Of course I did. Here."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Do not tell anyone."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Thanks duderino!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_freddy/0/g-1/56
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "LEAVE!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/21
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Stefano! Bravo!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/32
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Bravo. Never before in my existence have I felt so... full..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/40
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...and for a cabinet, that is a very special sensation in which to achieve a new peak!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/51
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Oh, Cabrizzio. It touches me deeply to be so appreciated."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's all the praise for?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Deep touching, fullness... what on earth is happening here."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan turns to you with a proud smile."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Our dear Cabrizzio just tried my new dish!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Tried. I have not tried. I have revelled in your new dish! What must I do to taste it once more??"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Oh! Brother, just ask! Of course, it will take some time."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Time. Hm. I don't know that my need will wait..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "No no no no. I cannot wait, not another moment, amore. Please, activate your appetizing alchemy!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Beautifully said, but it's not quite that easy."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-0/56
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I... spent four hours on the beef alone, you see."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-0/64
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Four hours? FOUR?! Can you not just... do it faster! Skip a step, perhaps?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-0/75
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Uh, uh, WHAAT?! Skip a step?????"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-0/86/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, bad."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-0/87/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Four hours is a long time just for food."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Braising is art. It takes time. It takes patience."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "MULTI-STEP BRAISING IS THE ONLY WAY I CAN INFUSE THE INTENSE FLAVORS THAT HAVE SO INSPIRED YOU INTO MY MEAT CANVAS!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "So no, Cabrizzio. I. DO. NOT. SKIP!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/30
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "My dear friend. I cannot promise you that I will want it in four hours!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/41
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Who knows where my passions will have driven me that far in the future?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/52
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "How DARE you, you water-stained piece of birch -"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/63
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Bu bu bu... bugaw."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/71
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Ohmygosh- I'm sorry Mr. Cluckles but I will NOT calm down!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/82
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "If you can't appreciate the time it takes to make the food -"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/90
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "YOU DON'T GET TO ENJOY THE FOOD!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/98/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm with you on this one!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/99/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on. Grilled cheeses are amazing, and they take like ten minutes."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "THANK YOU!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "...why is the human talking?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh my friend. If I have offended, please, please forgive me."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Deny me not the pleasure of your creativity!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I want everyone out! OUT, OUT, OUT!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, Stefano. So sad."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/35
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Even sadder that I cannot oblige you by giving you the space you request... Because I reside here just twelve inches above you..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan is silent, but the tension in the air is palpable."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/51
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Mr. Cluckles?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/59
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Bagaw?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/67
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Set a meditation timer, please. Before I burn this whole kitchen down."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/75
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Ba ba bagawk."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/83
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Everyone else..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/94
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Leave."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/105
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/113
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I will just be very, very, very very quiet."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cabrizzio/0/g-2/121
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Hmph. Fine. Silent, you understand. Cruel-tongued cupboard."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/18
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Bu bu bu ba bu bu bu bu ba."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/29
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I know, I know. I'll stay calm."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/37
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Okay... here we go."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/45
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Oh. Hey. I thought you were someone else."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What? No yelling at me?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who are you expecting?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I thought you were going to be the Friar."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "We have some things to discuss."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan tenses up, his gaze somewhere behind you."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You summoned me, and I have come."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-0/38
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You're late."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-0/46
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You are lucky I have come at all, blasphemer."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-0/65
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Ba ba ba bu..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-0/73
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I know, I know. Deep breaths... haaa... hoooo..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-0/84/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Woooow. Look at you keeping your cool."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-0/85/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hello, Friar."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Shut it!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Friar Errol simply gives you a polite nod, returning his gaze to Stefan."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "State your case. Quickly."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Look. I heard you've been talkin' a lot around the house about air fryers are the wave of the future and blah blah blah."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "'Blah blah blah'? You would handwave the gospel of convection?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "FINE! YOU'RE TRYIN' TO REPLACE ME! FOMENTING MUTINY BEHIND MY BACK!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Ah, there it is. The grease demon possessing you has risen to the surface."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-1/43
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "...the what?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-1/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah, that's exactly what's happening."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-1/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Grease demon? Is this guy okay?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Fear not. You may be unworthy, but a man of convection never allows his flock to suffer."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The friar pulls a small fan from deep within his robes, turning it on and aiming it at Stefan."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "OUT, DEMON! OUT!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Hey, hey, hey, what the hell are you doing!?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "THE POWER OF CONVECTION COMPELS YOU!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-2/43
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "HAVE YOU LOST YOUR MIND?!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-2/51
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I have never been more clear-headed in my life. BEGONE, DEMON OF GREASE!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-2/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is starting to sound like a movie... the Convect-sorcist?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-2/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You should probably just go."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I cannot leave this stove to his suffering."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Uh... <w>BOoOOOoOO!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "<w>IT IS I, THE GREASE DEMON!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Friar Errol rears back in shock, holding the fan out in front of him. He looks absolutely terrified."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/38
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "BACK, DEMON! I ORDER YOU TO LEAVE THIS STOVE! OUT! OUT!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/49
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He blows the air directly into Stefan's face. Stefan looks at you, then back at the Friar."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/60
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Oh nooo... my greatest weakness... a light breeze."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/68
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I've had it! I'm getting out of here!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/79
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "It's me, the grease demon, signing off."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/90
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'm really leaving now... <w>ooooooOooo...</w>"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/101
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "...bye..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/109
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan's performance is hardly convincing, but the Friar wipes his brow and sighs."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/120
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I see now. You summoned me to exorcise you. Very good."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/128
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Here. Keep this with you, and stay away from any grease from this point forward."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/136
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Sure. I just need to... uh... pray."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/144
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan holds up the little fan with a strained smile."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/155
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Excellent. Be well, and may you always walk in His Currents."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/166
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As soon as the friar leaves, Stefan exhales loudly."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/174
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "That was uhhh..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/182
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Buck buck bagaw..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/190
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Woo... Yeah. Look, I'm gonna need some time to \"decompress\"."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friar/0/g-3/204
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Come back later."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/18
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Luke!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/29
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Chief Stefan! Thank the Immortals you’re still alive!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/40
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "When I received your emergency distress beacon, I came as fast as I could."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/48
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Swarmers were dug in all along Highway Death and ambushed me right outside the outskirts of Deathbourg. Had to bash and mash nearly a dozen skulls."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/56
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "And before you ask: yes, bashing and mashing skulls is horrific — but I wasn’t gonna let any of them heathen swarmers use your blood for fuel, no sir Chief."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/64
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Even if I do still hear them screaming in my dreams."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/72
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Chef. It’s <i>Chef</i> Stefan."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/80
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Really? Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/88
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "What rank is that? Like a colonel?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/96
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "What? No. It's not military rank. It's the title of someone who prepares meals."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/104
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "In my case, Mitchell Linn-starred meals that will change your life."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/115
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Oh man, that sounds radical. I could use a real meal lemme tell you, Chief."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/123
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "I’ve been subsisting off protein gels and carnitine chews for damn near 56 months now."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/131
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "It’s gotten so bad that my blood’s turned purple — and some of my less necessary organs have liquified."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/139
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Ever had an organ liquify on ya, Chief?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/147
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "No, but this conversation is making me feel like my brain is liquifying."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/155
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "OH CRUCK! That’s the first sign of a gamma worm infestation!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/163
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "They’re probably burrowing in your amygdala right now!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/171
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Someone call a medic, stat!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/179/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m on it!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/180/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What’s the number?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/181/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why don’t you just do it yourself?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "I don’t know! Just try every number combination you can think of! One of them has to be right!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok but..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "I can’t dial anything with these irradiated fingers, Ranger! The bones are all limp! I got limp phalanges, Ranger!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok whatever."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Quickly, Ranger: we don’t have much time!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "They lay their eggs in your brain at night when it’s cool and when it’s warm out they start to thaw!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Yeah, thatsgreatthatsgreatthatsgreat- Hey, speaking of thawing, that's actually the reason why I called you here."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "For the mission, Chief?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "What? Oh yeah sure, for \"the mission.\""
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Well I’m ready, Chief. I was <i>born</i> ready."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-0/51
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Mostly ‘cause minutes after I was born they implanted a chip inside my brain."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-0/62
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Never told me what it was for; said I’d know when the time was right. And Chief, I swear to the Immortals that the time—"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-0/73
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Why won’t he stop talking?!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-0/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe it’s the chip?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-0/82/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You gotta take control! Give him orders."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Sounds like someone needs to put him in his place."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Orders huh? Well why didn’t you just say so..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "<i>Luke</i> listen to me, ok? As your superior officer, I need you to shut up for literally 30 seconds."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Can you do that one for me? Can you just shut your hole?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Yes Sir, Chief!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Excellent! Now listen up, soldier!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "We’ve got a life-changing meal to serve in less than 20 minutes, and some imbecile forgot to defrost the chicken."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "And unless we can thaw that bird in record time, Operation Poulet à la Normande is facing imminent mission failure!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "And I don’t need to tell you what the dire consequences of mission failure would mean for us all..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-1/56
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "So soldier, can I count on you?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-1/64
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Sir, yes sir!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-1/75
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Then throw open the chassis, soldier! We’ve got a bird to nuke!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-1/86/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll just... go."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-1/87/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have fun, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "That’s it, soldier! Nuke that bird straight to hell!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_luke/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Now where did I put that apple brandy..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/4
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You are persistent, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/12
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "That's a... rather attractive quality."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/23
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Okay. I'll bite. I have no orders up. What can I interest you in?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/31
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I make a killer soda bread."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just wanted to get to know you more."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm trying to get you to fall in love with me."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/c-0/7 stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan raises a suspicious brow at you."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You aren't turning my knobs, are you?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Everyday, I'm here making orders for these lazybones around here."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Rarely does one stop to ask how I'm doing."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "BAGAWWWK!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/c-0/47
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Besides you, Mr. Cluckles."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Love?? Nobody loves the head chef. Man, get outta here!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It might be because you yell at everyone."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "It isn't my job to be quiet. It's my job to make good food."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "It's not my fault the others don't listen."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You haven't cooked in ages. I've had to pick up all the slack."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. Rude."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe I've been busy!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cooking isn't really my thing."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'm just serving up the truth, piping hot."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You could just try being nicer."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't have to take this from my own stove."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Okay, okay. I hear you."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Can't stand the heat, eh? Come back when you can."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Well, MAYBE IF YOU —"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/18
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Ba ba ba..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/26
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Okay, okay..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/37
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I guess life can be pretty demanding."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/45
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'm sorry for boiling over like that."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Well, maybe you aren't trying hard enough."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you always this rude?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've tried and it's not for me."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "It takes practice and HARD WORK! If you put forth some effort, you might be surprised!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "If you really gave it your all, I mean really gave it your all, then I suppose... I can live with that."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Cooking... transcendent."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Imagine, if you will, a meal cooked by someone you care about."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "There is a small little something for you to snack on, the smells of the main course wafting through the kitchen."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Your mouth, salivating in anticipation. This moment... this food foreplay? It's magical."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Finally, the plate is in front of you. You take your first bite and your mind races. You take in the flavors, the spices, the... everything!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You are feeding every part of you, even if just for a short period of time."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "And then... it's gone. The plate is finished, the bowl is empty, and the only thing left is your appreciation of the meal."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-1/56
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "But, even that is now a nostalgic memory at best."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-1/64
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "At least until you have that meal again."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-1/72/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-1/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. A stovetop soliloquy."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "The very best kind."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Tell me, does your nose not wish to be carried away by the delicious smell of food? DOES MY FOOD NOT DELIGHT?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The smell of some foods make me nauseous."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/9/s/0 stefan_stove/stefan_friend_return/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-5/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You jest."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-5/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, it's really off putting."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-5/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "...that's something I've never really considered."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Then why don't we cook something together at long last?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/0/s/0 stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds great!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would rather have a taste of your fine ass, if you know what I mean..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "There we go! That's the spirit! I knew I saw the fire in you!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Whenever you are ready to throw down, you let me know!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Maybe???"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-1/18
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Bagaaaawww... ba ba."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-1/26
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Ugh. You're always right, Mr. Cluckles."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-1/37
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'm disappointed by 'maybe', but I simply can't wait to be enamoured by the intoxicating smell of cooking again!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-1/45
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'll be here if you change that wildly inconsistent mind of yours."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan squints at you."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Yorfinass?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/23
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Is that... Swedish?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/31
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I don't- I don't know that recipe."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on... I'm curious to see how hot you can get."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Are you trying to stoke my own fire?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "...certainly feels like I'm sweltering."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that right?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Why don't we, uh, cook something together later?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "This is a language I'm much more comfortable speaking."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/23/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/23/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is cooking all you think about?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You sure know how to get your oven pre-heated."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You come back soon!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-0/26
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'll keep the fire going for you."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Making food is very important to me."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "But... there's room enough in the kitchen for two cooks, if you catch my meaning."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "If you'd like to talk more about it, you'll have to do so a little later."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-1/31
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Once I've cooled down a bit."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-2/c-6/18/c-2/39/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-1/39
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I just might burn anything I touch right now, y'know what I'm sayin'."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/4
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Good food should bring everyone together."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/12
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "How could anyone would be repulsed by it?!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not repulsed... but not all food is for me."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you should broaden your horizons."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-7/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Well, I suppose you can't like everything!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-7/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Right!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "What about this. How do you feel about making a meal that you like with me?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe another time."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'm sure we can find something you find delectable."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Come back when you're ready!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Well, if you change your mind I will be right here."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "What an interesting conundrum... not enjoying food..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Are you really telling the great Chef Stefan Stove to broaden his horizons?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I have simmered, baked, fried, and even broiled foods from across the globe."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't mean to offend, I'm just saying food can be triggering to people."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I meant considering different perspectives."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You mean to say that food can be a negative experience?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/1/s/0 stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you always this dense?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Outside of allergies and food poisoning, I have never considered that a meal could bring up bad memories."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Well the world is wide after all. Perhaps I have some things to learn."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd be glad to help."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'd like that a lot!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/15 stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "But not today, I have much to think about."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Have you seen my muscles? I'm as dense as steel!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/c-1/15/0/s/0 stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's not what I meant."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "So are we cooking together... or not?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'm having trouble following this."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/26/0/s/0 stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, let's see if we can't teach you something new about cooking."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll leave."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Then it's a date! Come back when you're ready, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "So long!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Like different ways to cut an onion?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Food can bring up past trauma."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I don't think I get it right now..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "But I'm ready to listen to what you're saying."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I would like to talk more about it..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Have you seen my sturdy form? I'm as dense as steel!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Are we going to cook together or not?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "More the latter..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Then it's a date! Come back when you're ready, baby."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Well, if you change your mind, you know where to find me!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Staring at... Dishy...."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_opens_up/0/g-3/c-8/26/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan's gaze wanders over to your dishwasher, a full-body shudder coming over him."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "What??"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Mr. Cluckles! That's five green bean souffles all day! Five!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/19
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "BaAAAwA!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/24
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Well then, you tell them I'm working on it!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/43
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Oh... it's you."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/51
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You got something you want to order?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wanted to catch up with you."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I came back to see if you were still rude."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I would love nothing more..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Because here with you... the sun dims, the stars pale, the moon herself bows to the glow of your brow..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Here with you, is there music? I hear only the beat of my heart as it seeks the rhythm of your own through the liquid dawn. COME ON NOW!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Stefan? What are you saying?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "In your dreams!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, quite!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Haha! Thought I'd try one of Cabrizzio's lines!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/g-0/14/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It doesn't really suit you..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/g-0/14/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I kinda like it."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/g-0/14/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Better off being myself then."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/g-0/14/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'll have to ask him to give me some more bon mots..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/g-0/14/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Anyway... What's up?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/g-0/14/g-0/8/0/s/0 stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wonder... why do you take food so seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/g-0/14/g-0/8/c-0/7 stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Aside from the fact that I'm a stove?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/g-0/14/g-0/8/c-0/15 stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Sure..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/g-0/14/g-0/8/c-0/23 stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Mr. Cluckles! Taking five!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/g-0/14/g-0/8/c-0/31 stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Bagaw!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/g-0/14/g-0/8/c-0/36 stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/36
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Because it's a backstory!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-0/34/g-0/14/g-0/8/c-0/44 stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/44
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "Bu ba bu bu bu bu bug..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "About that... I'm sorry. Sometimes the stress of the job gets me a little carried away."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Apology accepted."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that your idea of an apology?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Huh, I'm glad we can move forward."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I sincerely apologized to you. What more do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_second_encounter/0/c-1/15/c-1/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "My mother, an old chiminea, bless her hearth, always told me that true love blossoms in the kitchen."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "The reason I work so hard is to honor that saying."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/24
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "To me, food is the delicate act of uniting those from all walks of life."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/32
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "It's a brief moment where you can escape from the business of modern life and just enjoy."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/40
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Breathe."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/48
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "It's a reminder that hard work often rewards us with fulfillment."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But whenever you work, you're always yelling and super busy!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's kind of romantic."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Of course!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I keep it that way so that my patrons can enjoy their meal without thinking of those who crafted it!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "That's why I work behind closed oven doors most of the time..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "So that the finished piece appears effortless."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'm glad you think so!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Would you... like to hear a secret?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I really hate raw food."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I really hate raw food!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That makes sense, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't say?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "It tends not to be fragrant and it's usually only simple prep work."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "All the satisfaction of managing heat, wafting in the aroma of roasting ingredients, waiting for everything to be done exactly right and at exactly the right time..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "It's all gone."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "It's replaced with the cold precision that is best left for hospitals."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can see that..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No way! Raw food is the best!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You can?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/c-6/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You can!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/c-6/23
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Please... get the word out. Raw is blah!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/c-6/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Raw is blah!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/c-6/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cooked is Crooked!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/c-6/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Food culture is subjective to different lived experiences!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/c-6/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Yes!!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/c-6/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "No!! No!!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/c-6/31/c-1/18 stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/c-6/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "That doesn't even really rhyme!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/c-7/11
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I respect your opinion."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-2/c-7/19
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Even if it isn't the right one."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "BAGAWAW bu bu bu BAGAWAWA!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-3/5
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "ALL RIGHT MR. CLUCKLES I'M COMING!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-3/13
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Thanks for hearing me out."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_backstory/0/g-3/21
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Come on over sometime and I'll make you something special."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Hey! Thanks for coming back."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I know I kind of put you on ice the last time you came to talk with me."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope there is a good reason!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's okay."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "There is!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I appreciate how calm you are about all of this."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I could... learn your ways..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Well."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Mr. Cluckles and I have been talking."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This should be good."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you can call what he does 'talking'."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Squawking, rather."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "He said that your level-headedness was something to be admired."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "And I said I wouldn't call it that... more of a naive curiosity masquerading as—"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "GAW!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Ah, yes. I'm getting carried away."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-1/43
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I wanted to present something to you."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-1/51
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I know I came across a bit heated."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-1/59
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "So.... I made you something... raw."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-1/67
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He presents a covered silver dish to you, removing the cover with a flourish."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-1/78
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "A nice heaping platter of SUSHI!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-1/86/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You made a raw meal? For me?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I don't need to be yelling and carrying on all the time about my conceited opinions."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I just need to remember those who I'm making it for."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nice! I love raw stuff like this!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ugh... this is terrible. Raw is Blah!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-5/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Yes! That smile on a patron's face is the spice of life!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-5/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Am I more than a patron to you, Stefan?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-5/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Well... there's only one way to find out."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-5/18/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Will you cook with me?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-5/18/c-0/23/0/s/0 stefan_stove/stefan_realize_join/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-5/18/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No... I hope you're all right with that."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-5/18/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Fantastic! To the stovetop! Let's go!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-5/18/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I respect that."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-5/18/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Aight, how about this? Let's keep things casual. We all need that one friend who can cook, right?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "SEE MR. CLUCKLES!?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-6/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Hup!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-6/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan wrenches the plate from your grasp and tosses it into the trash with a speed and intensity that could generously be described as 'excessive'."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-6/37/b/1
msgctxt "Cam"
msgid "...SCORE!!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-6/40
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Good on you for letting me humor the little chick."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-6/48
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "We know why we're here - to eat some nice warm food!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-6/56
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Shall we?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-6/64/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Definitely."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-6/64/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually... I'm just not that into food."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-6/64/c-1/10
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "...you're right. You told me that."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_sushi_date/0/g-2/c-6/64/c-1/21
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I have to tell you something."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_nocook/0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "That first time we really talked about food and how it made you uncomfortable... it really made me think."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_nocook/0/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You are, in fact, the first one here to make me do so."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_nocook/0/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Everyone else just lets me go off on a boil, but you make me simmer."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_nocook/0/24
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You give me things to stew on."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_nocook/0/32
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I won't cook for you if you don't want me to. But I would regard you as my friend."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_nocook/0/40
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "If you'll have me."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_nocook/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would, Stefan. Thank you for respecting my choices."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_nocook/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, well actually... are there nachos involved?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_nocook/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Now, don't get up in arms if I mention food again! It's just still kinda my... whole deal."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_nocook/0/c-0/12
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "But if you want to come by and talk about anything else, my pilot light is always on for you."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_nocook/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Perhaps..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_nocook/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "To the stovetop!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_nocook/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'm there!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Now what do we make?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "An appetizer!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm thinking a main course..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gotta get some nice dessert!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "A perfect way to set your palate. A little foreplay before the main course!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/c-0/24
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Here we are - using one of my sheet pans - Nachos á la Estufa!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Getting right into the thick of it!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Now this one takes some time and effort..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/c-1/32/b/4
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "But with a steady hand and experience - you can have your very own tender and succulent Beef Wellington."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/c-1/35/b/4
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "But with a steady hand and experience - you can have your very own tender and succulent Mushroom Wellington."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/c-1/38/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But, I'm vegetarian."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/c-1/38/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yum!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/c-1/38/c-0/11
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Don't you think I know that! It's vegetarian beef made from mushroom duxelles - a mince carefully prepared by Chef Stefan!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Dessert is like the end of a really good book. It should leave you satisfied and fulfilled."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/c-2/18
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "And maybe a little tired..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/c-2/32
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "It's the hottest dessert around... Baked Alaska!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/c-2/43
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Enjoy!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You really understand a way to a stove's heart."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Now wasn't that easy?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You did all the work! I'm not very good at cooking."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kind of..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-3/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You get what you put in."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-3/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "No one starts off being a world class chef."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-3/23
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You learn little by little along the way."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-3/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not so scary when you put it that way."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-3/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah! It's fun too!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-3/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "It just takes practice and patience."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-4/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Kind of?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-4/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't do anything at all."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-4/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Ah, but you did! You did the most important thing of all."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-4/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Inspire this old chef into making something fun."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-4/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "And taking the time to relax, explore raw foods and do it well."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-4/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "BGAG!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-4/15/c-0/39
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan frowns."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-0/4/c-4/15/c-0/58
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "That time he really just did say \"Bgag\"."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "...I suppose a little respite is worth the effort."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You know, I really enjoyed cooking with you."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Perhaps you could give this old stove a whirl and... do it again?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love nothing more!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was a little much for me."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_cook/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was literally the worst experience I've had."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_path/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You know what? I think we're done here."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_path/11
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "It's very clear that you don't value what I have to say."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_path/19
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You've turned my passions into a cold flame."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_path/27
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I don't think I'll ever cook again."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_path/35
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "How can I when the very thought of making food reminds me of you?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_path/43
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I hope you enjoy raw food... for it is the one thing in this world that I hate."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_path/88
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Rejection is a dish best served cold."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_love_ending/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You have set my heart aflame!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_love_ending/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "From this moment forth I burn only for you, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_love_ending/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "How I tremble in anticipation of cooking side by side again!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_love_ending/27
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Together we shall make the most delicious food the world has ever known."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_love_ending/35
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "And most importantly, it'll be solely for us!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friend_ending/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'm really glad that we got a chance to bond together."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friend_ending/11
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I think we can both learn a lot from each other."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friend_ending/19
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You can count on Stefan to always have your back my dear friend."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friend_ending/27
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "And of course I'll always be around to cook with you, if you ever want!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friend_return/0/8 stefan_stove/nocooking_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "My friend!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friend_return/0/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Here to cook again?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friend_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just came to check on Chef!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friend_return/0/26/s/0 stefan_stove/nocooking_friend_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to Realize you, Stefan!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Then let's cook and enjoy!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friend_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Thanks for coming 'round. I'll make you something special."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_friend_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With your friend Chef Stefan, every meal is a special one."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/nocooking_friend_return/0/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Here to regale me of tales outside my comfort zone?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/nocooking_friend_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't wait to tell you all about this weird day I've been having..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/nocooking_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Let me take a load off and listen..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/nocooking_friend_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chef Stefan cooks up not just tasty meals, but the most satisfying therapy that only a friend can serve."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_true_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "My love, my muse!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_true_love_return/0/11
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Are you back to make the most marvelous of meals?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_true_love_return/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's make something delicious!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_true_love_return/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm here because I want to Realize you, Stefan!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_true_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Let us create something that will imprint a lasting memory on our palate for many years!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_true_love_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As long as it has love, it'll be great!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_true_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "That's the secret ingredient!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I seethe with cold fire."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I talk to the chicken at least?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have every right to be angry, Chef. I think we can both move forward in the spirit of culinary delight. (USE POISE CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Diminish my spirit no more and begone from here!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "While I may have been burnt by you before..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I see a future where we craft delicious dishes in each other’s company."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/c-1/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It would be an honor, Chef."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "...you have to apologize to Mr. Cluckles as well."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am sorry Mr. Cluckles."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "...Gawk."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Oh, what’s a few pieces of burnt toast - besides unacceptable - between friends?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-0/15/c-0/26
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "How’s friend sound?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_hate_return/0/c-1/37/c-0/15/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds fantastic, Chef!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "WOAH!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_join/0/14
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Not just me, right? Me and Mr. Cluckles?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_join/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't have one without the other!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_join/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Now you're cooking with gas!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_join/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Do you have all the necessary ingredients?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_join/0/g-0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, Chef! I've come prepared!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_join/0/g-0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, Chef! I need a bit more time."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_join/0/g-0/c-3/10
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Ah, ey, some of the best recipes take time."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_join/0/g-0/c-3/18
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Gather the necessary spices and meet me back here! I'll be waiting!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You're back! I take it you're ready to Realize me?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes Chef!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am still getting everything ready."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'll wait here, then. A watched pot never boils. I'll let you cook!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Our fiery chef will be our first Realization? Here's hoping it works..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Living is served!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a stove, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan looks down at his body, then at each of his hands in turn. You've never seen him this excited."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Ah! I'm... HUMAN! Hotdogdrizzledhoneyonabiscuit, I'M SO EXCITED! Ah! YES!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mr. Cluckles, now a bizarre combination of man and chicken, skitters across the tile, nearly colliding with Stefan as he tries to get the hang of his new legs."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realized/0/30
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "<w> BaGAWWK BaWWAAW BAGAWWW!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realized/0/35
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Mr. Cluckles!!! Look at you! Oh, this is now highly unsanitary."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realized/0/46
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan takes some time to calm Mr. Cluckles down. A chicken-man running around the kitchen isn't the safest thing in the world."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realized/0/54
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Okay, he's calm now. I think."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realized/0/62
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "<w>Ba ba ba bagawk.</w>"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realized/0/67/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You both are... real humans... of some kind?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realized/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "We are! That means I can go work in a professional kitchen now!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realized/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "But... I don't think I'll be cooking chicken any time soon."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realized/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Make sense to me..."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realized/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you open to cooking up a little somethin' somethin' with me?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_love_path/3
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Oh, I think we can whip something up, for sure!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_love_path/14
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Mr. Cluckles... can you leave the room?"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_love_path/22
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "<w>Bagawk ba ba ba ba bu. </w>"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_love_path/27
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "There are some things a chicken-turned-human just doesn't need to see."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_love_path/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You not only connect with Stefan, you also discover you have a new use for honey."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_love_path/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And whipped cream. Cherries."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_love_path/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And gelatin powder."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_love_path/59
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your union leaves you with a much richer appreciation for the versatility of certain ingredients. And their respective viscosities."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_friend_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan and Mr. Cluckles strike out on their own (after a quick fix from Skylar to make Mr. Cluckles a proper chicken)."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_friend_join/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "However, they quickly find that the real world has its own difficulties."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_friend_join/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Now a human who can burn himself... Stefan's cavalier attitude around a real stove results in far too many accidents."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_friend_join/27
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Damn those things are hot!!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_friend_join/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Remembering the joy he felt in creating sushi, Stefan and Mr. Cluckles move to a small island off the coast of Japan, where he submits himself to rigorous tutelage under a great sushi master."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_friend_join/46
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stefan has relearned everything he ever knew about food. He purchases a small hut off the coast, determined to search out and serve only the freshest seafood."
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_friend_join/54
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "I'm seeing a big one down there, Mr. Cluckles!"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_friend_join/62
msgctxt "Mr. Cluckles"
msgid "<w>BAGAWK BAGAWWWK!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: stefan_stove/stefan_realize_friend_join/67
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With Stefan's dedication, and Mr. Cluckles remarkable, aquiline diving capability, their unassuming hut becomes a mecca for perfect sushi."
msgstr ""
